{"steam_appid":1714250,"steam_name":"Pets Hotel","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1714250/558693/faecc3e3c05f62fa4303811c439a857433156f54/1751022857/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747145326","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256941626/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1747145326","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714250/ss_2d4577fdb06aaef614fd5243030ff3039602ad7b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783534712","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714250/ss_d8c01631999e42fc5b0ca68b7c0ad7b2a4bba187.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783534712","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714250/ss_0c4e00ee80a089112d6c38b0be11c2213f689ee9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783534712","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714250/ss_d1e05e6abe4aac4515fdfbca175b345fd840e3c3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783534712","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714250/ss_eb7ac813aa17a99b37eea5e56c2841a7a3613e5a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783534712"],"about_the_game":"<strong>Start your adventure and open your own Pets Hotel!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714250/extras/d12f0b02b7aa7b82d63134d851308993.poster.avif?t=1783534712\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714250/extras/d12f0b02b7aa7b82d63134d851308993.webm?t=1783534712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714250/extras/d12f0b02b7aa7b82d63134d851308993.mp4?t=1783534712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Take care of the different types of animals</strong><br>All your little guests have different needs. Pet owners will tell you about them; it is your job to feed them according to their demands. Don’t forget about grooming and play-time! A satisfied customer is the best business strategy of all!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714250/extras/1b1e83509d58086c1ed0453124174a83.poster.avif?t=1783534712\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714250/extras/1b1e83509d58086c1ed0453124174a83.webm?t=1783534712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714250/extras/1b1e83509d58086c1ed0453124174a83.mp4?t=1783534712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Manage your pet hotel</strong><br>One of the biggest challenges that await you in Pets Hotel is designing and running a place where your customers can stay assured that they are leaving their beloved pets in good hands. Your competition never sleeps!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714250/extras/f86765108493d550c49a92e942f689a2.poster.avif?t=1783534712\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714250/extras/f86765108493d550c49a92e942f689a2.webm?t=1783534712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714250/extras/f86765108493d550c49a92e942f689a2.mp4?t=1783534712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Have fun with your guests!</strong><br>Your guests have their requirements! Make sure you get enough daily entertainment and exercise to keep them strong, healthy, and relaxed. Take them for walks, pet them, give them treats, and play with balls. Make all kinds of animals feel at home in your hotel.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714250/extras/38fb41b75e92d7a469dcd9d0b394c567.poster.avif?t=1783534712\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714250/extras/38fb41b75e92d7a469dcd9d0b394c567.webm?t=1783534712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714250/extras/38fb41b75e92d7a469dcd9d0b394c567.mp4?t=1783534712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Start from scratch and build your pet hotel empire!</strong><br>As the game progresses you will expand your business and make it the most premier pets hotel of all time! Imagine a place with a multitude of rooms, each designed and decorated for a different type of animal, with huge playgrounds surrounding your premium hotel! A truly fabulous place that you can create yourself.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714250/extras/b4552e42ce097c39fefd9c606f2b7583.poster.avif?t=1783534712\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714250/extras/b4552e42ce097c39fefd9c606f2b7583.webm?t=1783534712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714250/extras/b4552e42ce097c39fefd9c606f2b7583.mp4?t=1783534712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4690<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia GeForce GTX 780<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Games Incubator"],"publishers":["Games Incubator","PlayWay S.A."],"release_date":"17 Apr, 2023"}